sformation $T(x,y)↦(x,y-4)$ gives the  following:\n\n![](images/ce/ce31332cab19316dada01fff8fd558d49a11c56a1bb94fd0feb4b8f67b04b8bf.png)\n\n- Next, we apply the second transformation, $S(x,y)↦(-x,-y).$ This gives the following:\n\n![](images/31/312cc85ced38844c397a48509c67163af4efd4163b2154cf356918d9021443b2.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186536889 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186073779 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "9322724c-215a-5a91-a478-e91abe4038da" :knowledge-point/title "Determining the Image of a Polygon Under the Action of Multiple Transformations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "07487fa0-f3a2-5825-bfbb-b79cf47f4644" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/1d/1df98bf0799093ad120aa29c8dfad6ef15a96ce0479d26e583122f5061b22f29.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186536297} {:answer/id #uuid "3c6c1d0e-53ff-52af-8824-16779a64e3de" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/69/693dfda0e65ba72d2b60ed7c157e091b924746b65e7c4781c69adb415b6c8647.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186536377} {:answer/id #uuid "4fb381bb-e32f-5906-b517-945908791bf6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/ec/ec0ac2d9a590cfb544047dfb9dbfff90d519c2f99eb694e47ce6c4c9bcb3e38c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186536421} {:answer/id #uuid "aae19ad8-b288-5880-b7f5-961b25a421e7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/f9/f9473eeb4e70eaa521814935ffe2e2a80e03a0e7ae9a94b90cf5cc8f85b1f99a.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186536558} {:answer/id #uuid "cf25e246-9588-54b4-8faa-e964dc1cf66e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/6a/6ad6c18ff12c8f2d78632569debd608626250fe0d772115ad5be050448f900ad.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186536610}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "aae19ad8-b288-5880-b7f5-961b25